      "trackName": "Fruitozzo: Fruits Sudoku Game for Apple Watch",
      "description": "Best Fruit Sudoku on Earth for the Apple Watch OS2!\n\n- Apple Watch optimized game!\n- Play it for Free!\n- Earn Fruitcoins!\n\nTap on the screen to move the fruit and get only one of each fruit in the same line, row or box! Frozen fruit cannot be moved.\n\nStart Fruitozzo on your Apple Watch OS2 to play!",
